{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkdkfQht3pN2WWwBpYu8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I read all five screens. Now I'll write the answer the way Ilana would tell her son.\n\n---\n\n**Ilana, on the phone with her son:**\n\n\"Listen, I didn't find out what the account costs me. I'll ask you, or I'll ask the clerk at the bank. I'm not sure of much.\n\nThere's one thing I did take from it. Money that just sits in the עו\"ש loses value. They wrote that 10,000 ₪ left there for 10 years is worth 8,203 ₪ in today's money, '1,797 ₪ פחות', because 'רוב הבנקים משלמים בעו\"ש 0%'. That makes sense to me, it's prices going up. They also wrote that the bank has to send me a letter if more than '15,000.00 ₪' stays in the account for a whole quarter. So I understood that about 15,000 is the limit, and the rest shouldn't sit there. But they don't say where to put it. They say a 'קרן כספית', and I don't know what that is. Why not a פיקדון?\n\nThe cost was the reason I came, and it isn't there. There's a link 'עמלות ומחירים' at the top, and at the bottom there's 'מסלול בסיסי' and 'מסלול מורחב', with a line that every bank has to offer them. But there isn't one number about how much they cost.\n\nAnd something worried me. It says 'אין בישראל ביטוח פיקדונות: אם בנק קורס, אין חוק שמחזיר לכם את הכסף'. I'll have to ask you about that. At the very bottom it says 'אישי, לא מסחרי'. So I don't know who wrote this.\"\n\n**What I looked at:** the title and 'מה זה'. Then 'כמה כסף להחזיק בעו\"ש' (the 15,000). Then the box with 8,203 and the chart, though I only read the sentence above it. Then 'שווה לדעת': 4 out of 8 banks pay interest, 3% at Discount, up to 10,000. Then 'סיכונים ומה לא מוגן', and the 'מונחים' table, which I skimmed.\n\n**What I skipped:** the slider, the closed folds ('חלק מהבנקים כן משלמים ריבית', 'שחקו עם המספרים שלכם'), the link to the קרן כספית page and the 'חוקים וכללים' tags.\n\n**Where I got stuck:** on the chart it says the price of leaving the money there is '2,576', but above it said '1,797'. Which one is right? The two lines were yellow and light blue on black, and I couldn't tell them apart well.\n\n**What I'd change:** put the actual fee amounts on the page. Explain what to do with money above 15,000 in simple words. Make the grey text bigger, and use a light background."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1905,"cache_read_input_tokens":11656,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1905},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d7fdf04a-2fef-4991-bc2b-912166a3cf78","uuid":"869d32d4-e3b1-4186-9b38-5b68b7a8b28b","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:17:33.393Z","request_id":"req_011CgkdkfDJEBh584xKBKjow"}
